{
  "schema": 1,
  "map": "gm_cathedral_of_mercury",
  "addon": "gm_cathedral_of_mercury_rtx",
  "mod": "gm_cathedral_of_mercury_rtx",
  "title": "Cathedral of Mercury RTX",
  "prefix": "mercury_rtx",
  "global": "MercuryRTX",
  "index": "data_static/astra_mercury_rtx/gm_cathedral_of_mercury/rtx/index.json",
  "notes": [
    "From the companion's tone.lua (the Blender scene's custom rational curve as Hable, fixed exposure), atmosphere.lua (the runtime's default haze over the package's Modern House values), color_capture.lua ($color2 to white on the PBR materials), special.lua (animated water on the pool, particle on the base map's volume sprites) and zz_astra_mercury_rtx_baked.lua (legacy emissive on the four UnlitGeneric bakes).",
    "special.lua's ToPBR conversions of the glass and water are left out: since R19 MaterialPipeline.ToPBR.SetEnabled(true) takes effect only while the player's rtx_topbr_enabled is on.",
    "The sky: rtx.skyMode 0 (the map's own skybox) and the scene's own sun light; the companion's physical sky would add a second sun."
  ],
  "sky_owner": true,
  "fog_owner": true,
  "sky_keys": ["rtx.skyMode"],
  "clear_light2rtx": true,
  "remix": [
    ["rtx.skyMode", "0"],
    ["rtx.ignoreGamePointLights", "True"],
    ["rtx.ignoreGameSpotLights", "True"],
    ["rtx.ignoreGameDirectionalLights", "True"],
    ["rtx.volumetrics.transmittanceColor", "0.96,0.98,0.995"],
    ["rtx.volumetrics.transmittanceMeasurementDistanceMeters", "200"],
    ["rtx.volumetrics.singleScatteringAlbedo", "0.999,0.999,0.999"],
    ["rtx.volumetrics.anisotropy", "0.0"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.tonemapOperator", "3"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.exposureBias", "1"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.shoulderStrength", "0.9300000071525574"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.linearStrength", "0.5600000023841858"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.linearAngle", "0.05739232956097844"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.toeStrength", "0.2"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.toeNumerator", "0"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.toeDenominator", "0.7000000029802322"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.hable.whitePoint", "1.4219857332156554"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.exposureBias", "0"],
    ["rtx.autoExposure.enabled", "False"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.tonemappingEnabled", "True"],
    ["rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled", "False"]
  ],
  "runtime_defaults": {},
  "engine": [
    ["rtx_api_map_lights_autospawn", "0"]
  ],
